{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38879","headline":"秋日湖外书事 · 杜荀鹤","name":"秋日湖外书事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十五年来笔砚功，秪今犹在苦贫中。\n三秋客路湖光外，万里乡关楚邑东。\n鸟迳杖藜山翳雨，猿林欹枕树摇风。\n朱门处处若相似，此命到头通不通。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38879.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38879","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}